IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `sgta-nouns`

-- Telecommunications Act 1999 (Singapore), 2020 Revised Edition, informal consolidation (TA1999.txt).
-- PART 5A (continued): s 38 (control of equity interests and voting power in a designated telecommunication licensee, designated business trust
-- or designated trust) and s 39 (code of practice relating to that control).  2000 Revised Edition: not in that edition (Part 5A was inserted in 2011).
-- Seat: the person who acquires a stake (must I get approval first) and the licensee, trustee-manager or trustee that must notify.
-- The percentages are numbers in 0 to 100; "within 7 days" is days after first becoming aware.

§ `s 38 Control of equity interests and voting power`

-- src:3367 | 38.—(1) Subject to subsection (9), a designated telecommunication
-- src:3368 | licensee must give written notice to the Authority, within 7 days after
-- src:3369 | the designated telecommunication licensee first becomes aware of the
-- src:3370 | event, in the event that any person, whether by a series of transactions
-- src:3371 | over a period of time or otherwise —
-- src:3373 | (a) holds 5% or more but less than 12% of the total number of
-- src:3374 | voting shares in the designated telecommunication
-- src:3375 | licensee; or
-- src:3377 | (b) is in a position to control 5% or more but less than 12% of
-- src:3378 | the voting power in the designated telecommunication
-- src:3379 | licensee.
@ref s 38(1) (src:3367-3379)
GIVEN `percentage of the total number of voting shares in the designated telecommunication licensee that a person holds, whether by a series of transactions over a period of time or otherwise` IS A NUMBER
      `percentage of the voting power in the designated telecommunication licensee that a person is in a position to control` IS A NUMBER
      `the event occurs by virtue only of a transaction prescribed by the Minister under subsection (9)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 38(1): the designated telecommunication licensee must give written notice to the Authority within 7 days after it first becomes aware of the event` MEANS
    (NOT `the event occurs by virtue only of a transaction prescribed by the Minister under subsection (9)`)
    AND (    ((`percentage of the total number of voting shares in the designated telecommunication licensee that a person holds, whether by a series of transactions over a period of time or otherwise` AT LEAST 5) AND (`percentage of the total number of voting shares in the designated telecommunication licensee that a person holds, whether by a series of transactions over a period of time or otherwise` LESS THAN 12))
         OR ((`percentage of the voting power in the designated telecommunication licensee that a person is in a position to control` AT LEAST 5) AND (`percentage of the voting power in the designated telecommunication licensee that a person is in a position to control` LESS THAN 12)))

-- src:3383 | (2) Subject to subsection (9), the trustee-manager of a designated
-- src:3384 | business trust must give written notice to the Authority, within 7 days
-- src:3385 | after the trustee‑manager first becomes aware of the event, in the
-- src:3386 | event that any person, whether by a series of transactions over a
-- src:3387 | period of time or otherwise —
-- src:3389 | Informal Consolidation – version in force from 2/10/2026
-- src:3390 | 69 Telecommunications Act 1999 2020 Ed.
-- src:3392 | (a) holds 5% or more but less than 12% of the total number of
-- src:3393 | units in the designated business trust; or
-- src:3395 | (b) is in a position to control 5% or more but less than 12% of
-- src:3396 | the voting power in the designated business trust.
@ref s 38(2) (src:3383-3396)
GIVEN `percentage of the total number of units in the designated business trust that a person holds` IS A NUMBER
      `percentage of the voting power in the designated business trust that a person is in a position to control` IS A NUMBER
      `the event occurs by virtue only of a transaction prescribed by the Minister under subsection (9)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 38(2): the trustee-manager of the designated business trust must give written notice to the Authority within 7 days after it first becomes aware of the event` MEANS
    (NOT `the event occurs by virtue only of a transaction prescribed by the Minister under subsection (9)`)
    AND (    ((`percentage of the total number of units in the designated business trust that a person holds` AT LEAST 5) AND (`percentage of the total number of units in the designated business trust that a person holds` LESS THAN 12))
         OR ((`percentage of the voting power in the designated business trust that a person is in a position to control` AT LEAST 5) AND (`percentage of the voting power in the designated business trust that a person is in a position to control` LESS THAN 12)))

-- src:3400 | (3) Subject to subsection (9), the trustee of a designated trust must
-- src:3401 | give written notice to the Authority, within 7 days after the trustee
-- src:3402 | first becomes aware of the event, in the event that any person,
-- src:3403 | whether by a series of transactions over a period of time or
-- src:3404 | otherwise —
-- src:3406 | (a) holds 5% or more but less than 12% of the equity interests
-- src:3407 | in the designated trust; or
-- src:3409 | (b) is in a position to control 5% or more but less than 12% of
-- src:3410 | the voting power in the designated trust.
@ref s 38(3) (src:3400-3410)
GIVEN `percentage of the equity interests in the designated trust that a person holds` IS A NUMBER
      `percentage of the voting power in the designated trust that a person is in a position to control` IS A NUMBER
      `the event occurs by virtue only of a transaction prescribed by the Minister under subsection (9)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 38(3): the trustee of the designated trust must give written notice to the Authority within 7 days after it first becomes aware of the event` MEANS
    (NOT `the event occurs by virtue only of a transaction prescribed by the Minister under subsection (9)`)
    AND (    ((`percentage of the equity interests in the designated trust that a person holds` AT LEAST 5) AND (`percentage of the equity interests in the designated trust that a person holds` LESS THAN 12))
         OR ((`percentage of the voting power in the designated trust that a person is in a position to control` AT LEAST 5) AND (`percentage of the voting power in the designated trust that a person is in a position to control` LESS THAN 12)))

-- src:3414 | (4) Every person required to give a notice under subsection (1), (2)
-- src:3415 | or (3) must ensure that the notice —
-- src:3417 | (a) is given in such form and manner as the Authority may
-- src:3418 | determine; and
-- src:3420 | (b) is supported by such information as the Authority may
-- src:3421 | require.
@ref s 38(4) (src:3414-3421)
GIVEN `the notice is given in such form and manner as the Authority determines` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the notice is supported by such information as the Authority requires` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 38(4): the notice is as the person required to give it must ensure` MEANS
    `the notice is given in such form and manner as the Authority determines` AND `the notice is supported by such information as the Authority requires`

-- src:3425 | (5) Subject to subsection (10), a person must not, without obtaining
-- src:3426 | the prior written approval of the Authority to do so, become, whether
-- src:3427 | through a series of transactions over a period of time or otherwise, a
-- src:3428 | 12% controller or a 30% controller of a designated
-- src:3429 | telecommunication licensee, designated business trust or
-- src:3430 | designated trust.
@ref s 38(5) (src:3425-3430)
GIVEN `the person becomes, whether through a series of transactions over a period of time or otherwise, a 12% controller or a 30% controller of a designated telecommunication licensee, designated business trust or designated trust` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person has the prior written approval of the Authority` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it occurs by virtue only of a transaction prescribed under subsection (9)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 38(5): the person may become that controller` MEANS
    (NOT `the person becomes, whether through a series of transactions over a period of time or otherwise, a 12% controller or a 30% controller of a designated telecommunication licensee, designated business trust or designated trust`) OR `the person has the prior written approval of the Authority` OR `it occurs by virtue only of a transaction prescribed under subsection (9)`

-- src:3434 | (6) Subject to subsection (10), a person must not, without obtaining
-- src:3435 | the prior written approval of the Authority to do so, acquire any
-- src:3436 | business (of a designated telecommunication licensee, designated
-- src:3437 | business trust or designated trust) that is conducted pursuant to a
-- src:3438 | telecommunication licence granted under section 5, or any part of any
-- src:3439 | such business, as a going concern.
@ref s 38(6) (src:3434-3439)
GIVEN `the person acquires, as a going concern, a business (or part of one) of a designated telecommunication licensee, designated business trust or designated trust that is conducted pursuant to a telecommunication licence granted under section 5` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person has the prior written approval of the Authority` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it occurs by virtue only of a transaction prescribed under subsection (9)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 38(6): the person may acquire the business` MEANS
    (NOT `the person acquires, as a going concern, a business (or part of one) of a designated telecommunication licensee, designated business trust or designated trust that is conducted pursuant to a telecommunication licence granted under section 5`) OR `the person has the prior written approval of the Authority` OR `it occurs by virtue only of a transaction prescribed under subsection (9)`

-- src:3446 | (7) Subject to subsection (10), a person must not, without obtaining
-- src:3447 | the prior written approval of the Authority to do so, obtain effective
-- src:3448 | control over a designated telecommunication licensee, designated
-- src:3449 | business trust or designated trust.
@ref s 38(7) (src:3446-3449)
GIVEN `the person obtains effective control over a designated telecommunication licensee, designated business trust or designated trust` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person has the prior written approval of the Authority` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it occurs by virtue only of a transaction prescribed under subsection (9)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 38(7): the person may obtain effective control` MEANS
    (NOT `the person obtains effective control over a designated telecommunication licensee, designated business trust or designated trust`) OR `the person has the prior written approval of the Authority` OR `it occurs by virtue only of a transaction prescribed under subsection (9)`

-- src:3453 | (8) An application for the written approval of the Authority under
-- src:3454 | subsection (5), (6) or (7) —
-- src:3456 | (a) must be made in such form and manner as the Authority
-- src:3457 | may determine; and
-- src:3459 | (b) must be supported by such information as the Authority
-- src:3460 | may require.
@ref s 38(8) (src:3453-3460)
GIVEN `the application is made in such form and manner as the Authority determines` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the application is supported by such information as the Authority requires` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 38(8): the application for the Authority's written approval is as the subsection requires` MEANS
    `the application is made in such form and manner as the Authority determines` AND `the application is supported by such information as the Authority requires`

-- src:3464 | (9) A written notice need not be given to the Authority under
-- src:3465 | subsection (1), (2) or (3), if the event mentioned in the applicable
-- src:3466 | subsection occurs by virtue only of any transaction prescribed by the
-- src:3467 | Minister by order in the Gazette.
@ref s 38(9) (src:3464-3467)
GIVEN `the event occurs by virtue only of a transaction prescribed by the Minister by order in the Gazette` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 38(9): a written notice under subsection (1), (2) or (3) need not be given` MEANS
    `the event occurs by virtue only of a transaction prescribed by the Minister by order in the Gazette`

-- src:3473 | (10) Any person may, without obtaining the prior written approval
-- src:3474 | of the Authority to do so, do any thing mentioned in subsection (5),
-- src:3475 | (6) or (7), if the doing of that thing occurs by virtue only of any
-- src:3476 | transaction prescribed under subsection (9).
@ref s 38(10) (src:3473-3476)
GIVEN `the doing of the thing mentioned in subsection (5), (6) or (7) occurs by virtue only of a transaction prescribed under subsection (9)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 38(10): the person may do the thing without obtaining the prior written approval of the Authority` MEANS
    `the doing of the thing mentioned in subsection (5), (6) or (7) occurs by virtue only of a transaction prescribed under subsection (9)`

-- src:3482 | (11) A designated telecommunication licensee must give written
-- src:3483 | notice to the Authority, within 7 days after the designated
-- src:3484 | telecommunication licensee first becomes aware of the event, in
-- src:3485 | the event that any person, by virtue only of any transaction prescribed
-- src:3486 | under subsection (9) —
-- src:3488 | (a) becomes, whether through a series of transactions over a
-- src:3489 | period of time or otherwise, a 12% controller or a 30%
-- src:3490 | controller of the designated telecommunication licensee;
-- src:3492 | (b) acquires any business of the designated telecommunication
-- src:3493 | licensee that is conducted pursuant to a telecommunication
-- src:3494 | licence granted under section 5, or any part of any such
-- src:3495 | business, as a going concern; or
-- src:3497 | Informal Consolidation – version in force from 2/10/2026
-- src:3498 | 71 Telecommunications Act 1999 2020 Ed.
-- src:3500 | (c) obtains effective control over the designated
-- src:3501 | telecommunication licensee.
@ref s 38(11) (src:3482-3501)
GIVEN `a person, by virtue only of a transaction prescribed under subsection (9), becomes a 12% controller or a 30% controller of the designated telecommunication licensee` IS A BOOLEAN
      `a person, by virtue only of such a transaction, acquires as a going concern a business (or part) of the licensee conducted pursuant to a telecommunication licence granted under section 5` IS A BOOLEAN
      `a person, by virtue only of such a transaction, obtains effective control over the designated telecommunication licensee` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 38(11): the designated telecommunication licensee must give written notice to the Authority within 7 days after it first becomes aware of the event` MEANS
    `a person, by virtue only of a transaction prescribed under subsection (9), becomes a 12% controller or a 30% controller of the designated telecommunication licensee` OR `a person, by virtue only of such a transaction, acquires as a going concern a business (or part) of the licensee conducted pursuant to a telecommunication licence granted under section 5` OR `a person, by virtue only of such a transaction, obtains effective control over the designated telecommunication licensee`

-- src:3507 | (12) The trustee-manager of a designated business trust must give
-- src:3508 | written notice to the Authority, within 7 days after the
-- src:3509 | trustee‑manager first becomes aware of the event, in the event that
-- src:3510 | any person, by virtue only of any transaction prescribed under
-- src:3511 | subsection (9) —
-- src:3513 | (a) becomes, whether through a series of transactions over a
-- src:3514 | period of time or otherwise, a 12% controller or a 30%
-- src:3515 | controller of the designated business trust;
-- src:3517 | (b) acquires any business of the designated business trust that
-- src:3518 | is conducted pursuant to a telecommunication licence
-- src:3519 | granted under section 5, or any part of any such business,
-- src:3520 | as a going concern; or
-- src:3522 | (c) obtains effective control over the designated business trust.
@ref s 38(12) (src:3507-3522)
GIVEN `a person, by virtue only of a transaction prescribed under subsection (9), becomes a 12% controller or a 30% controller of the designated business trust` IS A BOOLEAN
      `a person, by virtue only of such a transaction, acquires as a going concern a business (or part) of the designated business trust conducted pursuant to a telecommunication licence granted under section 5` IS A BOOLEAN
      `a person, by virtue only of such a transaction, obtains effective control over the designated business trust` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 38(12): the trustee-manager of the designated business trust must give written notice to the Authority within 7 days after it first becomes aware of the event` MEANS
    `a person, by virtue only of a transaction prescribed under subsection (9), becomes a 12% controller or a 30% controller of the designated business trust` OR `a person, by virtue only of such a transaction, acquires as a going concern a business (or part) of the designated business trust conducted pursuant to a telecommunication licence granted under section 5` OR `a person, by virtue only of such a transaction, obtains effective control over the designated business trust`

-- src:3528 | (13) The trustee of a designated trust must give written notice to the
-- src:3529 | Authority, within 7 days after the trustee first becomes aware of the
-- src:3530 | event, in the event that any person, by virtue only of any transaction
-- src:3531 | prescribed under subsection (9) —
-- src:3533 | (a) becomes, whether through a series of transactions over a
-- src:3534 | period of time or otherwise, a 12% controller or a 30%
-- src:3535 | controller of the designated trust;
-- src:3537 | (b) acquires any business of the designated trust that is
-- src:3538 | conducted pursuant to a telecommunication licence
-- src:3539 | granted under section 5, or any part of any such
-- src:3540 | business, as a going concern; or
-- src:3542 | (c) obtains effective control over the designated trust.
@ref s 38(13) (src:3528-3542)
GIVEN `a person, by virtue only of a transaction prescribed under subsection (9), becomes a 12% controller or a 30% controller of the designated trust` IS A BOOLEAN
      `a person, by virtue only of such a transaction, acquires as a going concern a business (or part) of the designated trust conducted pursuant to a telecommunication licence granted under section 5` IS A BOOLEAN
      `a person, by virtue only of such a transaction, obtains effective control over the designated trust` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 38(13): the trustee of the designated trust must give written notice to the Authority within 7 days after it first becomes aware of the event` MEANS
    `a person, by virtue only of a transaction prescribed under subsection (9), becomes a 12% controller or a 30% controller of the designated trust` OR `a person, by virtue only of such a transaction, acquires as a going concern a business (or part) of the designated trust conducted pursuant to a telecommunication licence granted under section 5` OR `a person, by virtue only of such a transaction, obtains effective control over the designated trust`

-- src:3551 | (14) Subject to subsection (15), any person who contravenes
-- src:3552 | subsection (2), (3), (12) or (13) shall be guilty of an offence and
-- src:3553 | shall be liable on conviction to a fine not exceeding $10,000.
@ref s 38(14) (src:3551-3553)
GIVEN `the person contravenes subsection (2), (3), (12) or (13)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person is a telecommunication licensee that is a trustee-manager of a designated business trust, or a trustee of a designated trust` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE `Penalty`
`s 38(14) and (15): the person is guilty of an offence and the most the penalty may be` MEANS
    BRANCH IF `the person contravenes subsection (2), (3), (12) or (13)` AND (NOT `the person is a telecommunication licensee that is a trustee-manager of a designated business trust, or a trustee of a designated trust`) THEN JUST (`Penalty` OF 10000, 0, 0, FALSE)
           OTHERWISE NOTHING

-- src:3557 | (15) Subsection (14) does not apply to a telecommunication
-- src:3558 | licensee that is —
-- src:3560 | (a) a trustee‑manager of a designated business trust; or
-- src:3562 | (b) a trustee of a designated trust.
@ref s 38(15) (src:3557-3562)
GIVEN `the person is a telecommunication licensee that is a trustee-manager of a designated business trust` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person is a telecommunication licensee that is a trustee of a designated trust` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 38(15): subsection (14) applies to the telecommunication licensee` MEANS
    NOT (`the person is a telecommunication licensee that is a trustee-manager of a designated business trust` OR `the person is a telecommunication licensee that is a trustee of a designated trust`)

§ `s 39 Power to issue code of practice relating to control`

-- src:3572 | 39.—(1) Without limiting section 30, the Authority may issue a
-- src:3573 | code of practice under that section which specifies such matters as are
-- src:3574 | generally necessary for carrying out the purposes and provisions of
-- src:3575 | this Part and for the due administration thereof.
@ref s 39(1) (src:3572-3575)
GIVEN `the matter is generally necessary for carrying out the purposes and provisions of Part 5A and for its due administration` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 39(1): the Authority may issue a code of practice under section 30 specifying the matter` MEANS
    `the matter is generally necessary for carrying out the purposes and provisions of Part 5A and for its due administration`

-- src:3579 | (2) Without limiting subsection (1), the Authority may specify in
-- src:3580 | the code of practice —
-- src:3582 | (a) the rules and procedures that each of the following must
-- src:3583 | comply with:
-- src:3585 | (i) a designated telecommunication licensee;
-- src:3587 | (ii) a person who holds any voting shares, or controls any
-- src:3588 | voting power, in a designated telecommunication
-- src:3589 | licensee;
-- src:3591 | (iii) a person who holds any units, or controls any voting
-- src:3592 | power, in a designated business trust;
-- src:3594 | (iv) a person who holds any equity interest, or controls
-- src:3595 | any voting power, in a designated trust;
-- src:3597 | (v) a person who acquires any business (of a designated
-- src:3598 | telecommunication licensee, designated business
-- src:3599 | trust or designated trust) that is conducted pursuant
-- src:3600 | to a telecommunication licence granted under
-- src:3602 | Informal Consolidation – version in force from 2/10/2026
-- src:3603 | 73 Telecommunications Act 1999 2020 Ed.
-- src:3605 | section 5, or any part of any such business, as a going
-- src:3606 | concern;
-- src:3608 | (vi) a person who obtains effective control over a
-- src:3609 | designated telecommunication licensee, designated
-- src:3610 | business trust or designated trust;
-- src:3612 | (b) the terms and conditions which the Authority may impose
-- src:3613 | when granting any written approval under section 38(5),
-- src:3614 | (6) or (7); and
-- src:3616 | (c) the fees and charges payable to the Authority in respect of
-- src:3617 | any application or request made to the Authority under the
-- src:3618 | code of practice.
-- src:3619 | [32C
@ref s 39(2) (src:3579-3619)
GIVEN specification IS A STRING
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 39(2): the Authority may specify this in the code of practice` MEANS
    elem specification (LIST "the rules and procedures that a designated telecommunication licensee must comply with"
                            , "the rules and procedures that a person who holds voting shares, or controls voting power, in a designated telecommunication licensee must comply with"
                            , "the rules and procedures that a person who holds units, or controls voting power, in a designated business trust must comply with"
                            , "the rules and procedures that a person who holds an equity interest, or controls voting power, in a designated trust must comply with"
                            , "the rules and procedures that a person who acquires a business, or part of one, as a going concern conducted pursuant to a telecommunication licence granted under section 5 must comply with"
                            , "the rules and procedures that a person who obtains effective control over a designated telecommunication licensee, designated business trust or designated trust must comply with"
                            , "the terms and conditions which the Authority may impose when granting any written approval under section 38(5), (6) or (7)"
                            , "the fees and charges payable to the Authority in respect of any application or request made to the Authority under the code of practice")
